<title>USA: DI Industries acquires Flournoy assets.</title>
<headline>DI Industries acquires Flournoy assets.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>DI Industries Inc said on Friday it acquired the operating assets of Flournoy Drilling Co for 12.4 million shares of DI common stock.</p>
<p>The deal also included $800,000 in cash, which was used to retire debt.</p>
<p>Flournoy assets acquired include 13 drilling rigs and 17 rig-hauling trucks.  DI now has 30 rigs operating in South Texas.</p>
</text>
